---
// 404 Not Found Component
---

<section class="bg-background min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-16">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center max-w-lg mx-auto text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary mb-6 ring-8 ring-primary/5">
            <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-wider font-mono">404</span>
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-default sm:text-4xl">
            頁面不存在
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm font-medium text-primary mt-1 uppercase tracking-widest">
            Page Not Found
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4 text-offset text-base max-w-md">
            您嘗試存取的頁面可能已被移除、名稱已變更，或暫時無法使用。請確認網址是否正確，或返回首頁繼續瀏覽。
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full justify-center">
            <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-200 rounded-lg bg-primary hover:bg-secondary shadow-md hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary focus:ring-offset-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"></path>
                </svg>
                返回個人首頁 (Home)
            </a>
            <button onclick="window.history.back()" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-default transition-all duration-200 rounded-lg bg-background border border-offset/20 hover:bg-offset/10 focus:outline-none">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path>
                </svg>
                回上一頁 (Back)
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
